["<details class=\"gd\" data-level=\"n5\"><summary><span class=\"gd-p\" lang=\"ja\">〜も</span><span class=\"lvb\">N5</span><span class=\"gd-m\"><span class=\"t-zh\">也；与否定搭配表示“也不”</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">also; too; (with a negative) not ... either; neither ... nor</span></span></span></summary><div class=\"gd-body\"><p class=\"gp-conn\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">接续</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">名词 + も</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Noun + も</span></span></p><ul class=\"gp-ex\"><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>学生<rp>(</rp><rt>がくせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">我也是学生。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">I&#x27;m a student too.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>兄<rp>(</rp><rt>あに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はサッカーも<ruby>好<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">哥哥也喜欢足球。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">My older brother likes soccer too.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>肉<rp>(</rp><rt>にく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>魚<rp>(</rp><rt>さかな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">我既不吃肉，也不吃鱼。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">I eat neither meat nor fish.</span></span></span></li></ul><p class=\"note\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">补充</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">補足</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">「も」可以替换「は」「が」「を」；其他助词一般保留，例如「京都にも行きました」。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">も replaces は, が and を, but comes after other particles: 京都にも行きました.</span></span></p><p class=\"gd-more\"><a href=\"https://github.com/evanclan/OpenJLPT/blob/main/data/json/grammar/n5.json\"><span class=\"t-zh\">查看 OpenJLPT 来源</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">OpenJLPT の出典を見る</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"> →</span></a></p></div></details>","<details class=\"gd\" data-level=\"n5\"><summary><span class=\"gd-p\" lang=\"ja\">もう〜た</span><span class=\"lvb\">N5</span><span class=\"gd-m\"><span class=\"t-zh\">已经做了……；疑问句中问“……了吗？”</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">already (have done); (in questions) yet</span></span></span></summary><div class=\"gd-body\"><p class=\"gp-conn\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">接续</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">もう + 动词た形 / もう + 动词ます形去「ます」 + ました</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">もう + Verb-ta / もう + Verb-stem + ました</span></span></p><ul class=\"gp-ex\"><li><span lang=\"ja\">「もう<ruby>晩<rp>(</rp><rt>ばん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ご<ruby>飯<rp>(</rp><rt>はん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べましたか。」「はい、もう<ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べました。」</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">“你吃过晚饭了吗？”“嗯，已经吃过了。”</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">&quot;Have you eaten dinner yet?&quot; &quot;Yes, I already have.&quot;</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>妹<rp>(</rp><rt>いもうと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はもう<ruby>寝<rp>(</rp><rt>ね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">妹妹已经睡了。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">My younger sister has already gone to bed.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>映画<rp>(</rp><rt>えいが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はもう<ruby>始<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まりましたよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">电影已经开始了。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">The movie has already started.</span></span></span></li></ul><p class=\"note\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">补充</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">補足</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">疑问句中的「もう」相当于「已经……了吗？」。后接否定时表示「不再」，如「もう食べません」。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">In questions もう means &#x27;yet&#x27;. With a negative verb, もう means &#x27;no longer&#x27;: もう食べません.</span></span></p><p class=\"gd-more\"><a href=\"https://github.com/evanclan/OpenJLPT/blob/main/data/json/grammar/n5.json\"><span class=\"t-zh\">查看 OpenJLPT 来源</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">OpenJLPT の出典を見る</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"> →</span></a></p></div></details>","<details class=\"gd\" data-level=\"n5\"><summary><span class=\"gd-p\" lang=\"ja\">〜や</span><span class=\"lvb\">N5</span><span class=\"gd-m\"><span class=\"t-zh\">列举部分事例，意为“……之类”</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">and (giving some examples out of more); ... and so on</span></span></span></summary><div class=\"gd-body\"><p class=\"gp-conn\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">接续</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">名词 + や + 名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Noun + や + Noun</span></span></p><ul class=\"gp-ex\"><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>机<rp>(</rp><rt>つくえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>うえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>本<rp>(</rp><rt>ほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>や<ruby>雑誌<rp>(</rp><rt>ざっし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があります。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">桌上有书、杂志之类的东西。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">On the desk there are books, magazines and so on.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\">スーパーで<ruby>肉<rp>(</rp><rt>にく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>や<ruby>野菜<rp>(</rp><rt>やさい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">我在超市买了肉、蔬菜等东西。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">I bought meat, vegetables and other things at the supermarket.</span></span></span></li></ul><p class=\"note\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">补充</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">補足</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">表示列举未尽，末尾常加「など」，例如「本や雑誌など」。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Suggests the list is not complete. Often ends with など: 本や雑誌など.</span></span></p><p class=\"gd-more\"><a href=\"https://github.com/evanclan/OpenJLPT/blob/main/data/json/grammar/n5.json\"><span class=\"t-zh\">查看 OpenJLPT 来源</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">OpenJLPT の出典を見る</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"> →</span></a></p></div></details>","<details class=\"gd\" data-level=\"n5\"><summary><span class=\"gd-p\" lang=\"ja\">〜よ</span><span class=\"lvb\">N5</span><span class=\"gd-m\"><span class=\"t-zh\">告知新信息或加强语气</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">you know; I tell you (giving new information or emphasis)</span></span></span></summary><div class=\"gd-body\"><p class=\"gp-conn\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">接续</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">句子 + よ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Sentence + よ</span></span></p><ul class=\"gp-ex\"><li><span lang=\"ja\">このラーメンはとてもおいしいですよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">这碗拉面真的很好吃。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">This ramen is really good, you know.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\">かさを<ruby>忘<rp>(</rp><rt>わす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れていますよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">你的伞忘拿了。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">You&#x27;re forgetting your umbrella.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>明日<rp>(</rp><rt>あした</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はテストがありますよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">明天有考试哦。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">There&#x27;s a test tomorrow, you know.</span></span></span></li></ul><p class=\"note\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">补充</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">補足</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">传达对方可能不知道的事情。对上级频繁使用「よ」可能显得语气过强。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Tells the listener something they may not know. Overusing it with superiors can sound pushy.</span></span></p><p class=\"gd-more\"><a href=\"https://github.com/evanclan/OpenJLPT/blob/main/data/json/grammar/n5.json\"><span class=\"t-zh\">查看 OpenJLPT 来源</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">OpenJLPT の出典を見る</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"> →</span></a></p></div></details>","<details class=\"gd\" data-level=\"n5\"><summary><span class=\"gd-p\" lang=\"ja\">〜より</span><span class=\"lvb\">N5</span><span class=\"gd-m\"><span class=\"t-zh\">比……，标记比较的基准</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">than (the standard of comparison)</span></span></span></summary><div class=\"gd-body\"><p class=\"gp-conn\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">接续</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">名词 + より</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Noun + より</span></span></p><ul class=\"gp-ex\"><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>今日<rp>(</rp><rt>きょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はきのうより<ruby>寒<rp>(</rp><rt>さむ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">今天比昨天冷。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Today is colder than yesterday.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>電車<rp>(</rp><rt>でんしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はバスより<ruby>速<rp>(</rp><rt>はや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">电车比公交车快。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Trains are faster than buses.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>兄<rp>(</rp><rt>あに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>父<rp>(</rp><rt>ちち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>より<ruby>背<rp>(</rp><rt>せ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>高<rp>(</rp><rt>たか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">哥哥比爸爸高。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">My older brother is taller than my father.</span></span></span></li></ul><p class=\"note\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">补充</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">補足</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">在「甲は乙より＋形容词」中，乙是比较基准。日语形容词不用另变比较级。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">In X は Y より + adjective, Y is the standard. Japanese adjectives have no &#x27;-er&#x27; form; より does that job.</span></span></p><p class=\"gd-more\"><a href=\"https://github.com/evanclan/OpenJLPT/blob/main/data/json/grammar/n5.json\"><span class=\"t-zh\">查看 OpenJLPT 来源</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">OpenJLPT の出典を見る</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"> →</span></a></p></div></details>","<details class=\"gd\" data-level=\"n5\"><summary><span class=\"gd-p\" lang=\"ja\">〜を</span><span class=\"lvb\">N5</span><span class=\"gd-m\"><span class=\"t-zh\">标记宾语，或经过、离开的地点</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">marks the direct object of a verb; marks a place moved through or left</span></span></span></summary><div class=\"gd-body\"><p class=\"gp-conn\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">接续</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">名词 + を</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Noun + を</span></span></p><ul class=\"gp-ex\"><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>毎朝<rp>(</rp><rt>まいあさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>パンを<ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">我每天早上都吃面包。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">I eat bread every morning.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>姉<rp>(</rp><rt>あね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>新<rp>(</rp><rt>あたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しいかばんを<ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">姐姐买了一个新包。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">My older sister bought a new bag.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>公園<rp>(</rp><rt>こうえん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>散歩<rp>(</rp><rt>さんぽ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">我在公园里散了步。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">I took a walk in the park.</span></span></span></li></ul><p class=\"note\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">补充</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">補足</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">写作「を」，读作 o。和「歩く」「散歩する」「出る」等移动动词连用时，可标记经过的路线或离开的地点。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Written を but pronounced &#x27;o&#x27;. With movement verbs such as 歩く, 散歩する and 出る it marks the route or the place being left.</span></span></p><p class=\"gd-more\"><a href=\"https://github.com/evanclan/OpenJLPT/blob/main/data/json/grammar/n5.json\"><span class=\"t-zh\">查看 OpenJLPT 来源</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">OpenJLPT の出典を見る</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"> →</span></a></p></div></details>","<details class=\"gd\" data-level=\"n5\"><summary><span class=\"gd-p\" lang=\"ja\">〜をください</span><span class=\"lvb\">N5</span><span class=\"gd-m\"><span class=\"t-zh\">请给我某物；点单时表示“我要……”</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">please give me (something); I&#x27;ll have</span></span></span></summary><div class=\"gd-body\"><p class=\"gp-conn\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">接续</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">名词 + をください</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Noun + をください</span></span></p><ul class=\"gp-ex\"><li><span lang=\"ja\">すみません、<ruby>水<rp>(</rp><rt>みず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">不好意思，请给我一杯水。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Excuse me, could I have some water?</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\">このりんごを<ruby>三<rp>(</rp><rt>みっ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">这种苹果请给我三个。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">I&#x27;ll take three of these apples, please.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\">メニューをください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">请给我看一下菜单。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Could I have the menu, please?</span></span></span></li></ul><p class=\"note\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">补充</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">補足</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">常用于购物或点单。数量可直接放在「を」后，如「切手を二枚ください」。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Used when shopping or ordering. A quantity goes after を with no particle: 切手を二枚ください.</span></span></p><p class=\"gd-more\"><a href=\"https://github.com/evanclan/OpenJLPT/blob/main/data/json/grammar/n5.json\"><span class=\"t-zh\">查看 OpenJLPT 来源</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">OpenJLPT の出典を見る</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"> →</span></a></p></div></details>","<details class=\"gd\" data-level=\"n5\"><summary><span class=\"gd-p\" lang=\"ja\">〜を〜ます</span><span class=\"lvb\">N5</span><span class=\"gd-m\"><span class=\"t-zh\">「を」表示动作的对象（宾语）。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">「を」は動作の対象を表す。</span></span></summary><div class=\"gd-body\"><p class=\"gp-conn\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">接续</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">名词＋を＋他动词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞＋を＋他動詞</span></p><ul class=\"gp-ex\"><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>毎朝<rp>(</rp><rt>まいあさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>新聞<rp>(</rp><rt>しんぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>読<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">每天早上看报纸。</span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>昨日<rp>(</rp><rt>きのう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、カレーを<ruby>作<rp>(</rp><rt>つく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">昨天做了咖喱。</span></li></ul><p class=\"gd-more\"><a href=\"#g2\"><span class=\"t-zh\">查看精选讲解</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">詳しい解説を見る</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"> →</span></a></p></div></details>"]